
Queries

A. Customer Analysis
Who are the top 10 customers based on total spending?
Which cities have the highest number of customers?
How many orders does each customer place?
Who are the customers with the highest number of orders?
What is the average spending per customer?


select c.customer_id,
c.customer_name,
c.city,
round(sum(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price),2) As Total_Spending
from customers c
join orders o
on c.customer_id = o.customer_id
join order_items oi
on o.order_id = oi.order_id
where o.order_status = "Delivered"
group by 
c.customer_id,
c.customer_name,
c.city
order by Total_Spending desc
limit 10;

